## Layout

- `src/` — code organized **by feature**: one folder per feature, everything the
  feature needs colocated. See `src/AGENTS.md`.
- `tests/` — vitest suite mirroring the feature folders. See `tests/AGENTS.md`.

## Commands

- `pnpm install` — dependencies (pnpm only; never npm or yarn)
- `pnpm check` — typecheck + lint + test, the full gate
- `pnpm typecheck` / `pnpm lint` / `pnpm test` — individually
- `pnpm format` — Biome format

## Rules

- One function, one job. Cognitive complexity cap 15 (Biome, error) — decompose
  instead of suppressing.
- Files stay under **300 lines**; new feature = new folder, not growth of an
  existing file.
- tsconfig is strict plus `noUncheckedIndexedAccess`/`exactOptionalPropertyTypes`;
  no `@ts-ignore` — use `@ts-expect-error` with a reason comment if unavoidable.
- No barrel re-export files beyond a feature's own entry point.
- ESM only (`type: module`); imports use explicit `.js` extensions per NodeNext.
